  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Banco Familiar: Senior Loan to Promote Financial Health in Paraguay</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project includes an unsecured senior loan to Banco Familiar S.A.E.C.A. for an amount of up to PYG360 billion (the &quot;Loan&quot;), to be financed by IDB Invest, and to be disbursed in tranches. The loan term is up to six years, with a two-year grace period and semi-annual amortization. Project funds will be used to provide local currency financing for microenterprises and small entrepreneurs at the base of the pyramid, promoting financial inclusion in Paraguay.</narrative>
  </description>
